kravciak in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1616\n* bug(https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/issues/1617) : a change in the implementation of feat(1406); by @yakom in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1618\n* fix(registry): prevent --registry-use from triggering registry creation by @iwilltry42 in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1646\n* fix(entrypoint): skip drain/uncordon on agent nodes by @dpritchett in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1648\n* docs: update k3d-demo repo url by @isayme in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1655\n* docs: fix md list issues by @isayme in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1657\n* feat: cluster restart cmd, fix #984 by @isayme in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1660\n* chore(deps): refresh deps + base images for v5.9.0 by @iwilltry42 in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1670\n* chore(deps): update dependency pymdown-extensions to v10.21.3 [security] by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1635\n\n## New Contributors\n* @AdrienHorgnies made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1567\n* @tiaoxizhan made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1562\n* @sofushn made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1582\n* @lfrancke made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1589\n* @kobayashiyabako16g made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1590\n* @dpritchett made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1648\n* @isayme made their first contribution in https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/pull/1655\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/compare/v5.8.3...v5.9.0","discussion_url":"https://github.com/k3d-io/k3d/discussions/1675","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k3d-io/k3d/releases/333174598/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":13}